{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15218160","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15218160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1521816001:0":{"text":"혹시 에누르 할머니가 어디 사는지 알아?","source_cn":"你知道艾努尔婆婆住在哪里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F2A001EDCBF421D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521816002:1":{"text":"아... 물건을 사러 오신 손님이 아니셨군요.","source_cn":"啊……原来不是来买东西的客人啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2BA5F0E1F6C9981","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521816003:1":{"text":"에누르 할머니라면, 그 지휘관님이 자주 찾아뵙던 그 노부인 말씀하시는 거죠?","source_cn":"你们说的艾努尔，是统帅常来探望的那个老妇人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x624D23B143B87139","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521816004:1":{"text":"맞아!","source_cn":"对，就是她！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6E602730B93A390","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521816005:1":{"text":"할머니는 <style=\"highlight\">성 밖에 살고 계세요</style>. 정확히 어딘지는 저도 잘 몰라요.","source_cn":"她<style=highlight>住在城外</sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02A2E5A741BA5807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_c